        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "43d3b814-86a7-5f99-b3a3-474166d914ab",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Detroit\n- People: Kathryn Bigelow, Mark Boal, Will Poulter, Laz Alonso\n- Events: Algiers Motel incident, 1967 Detroit riot, 12th Street riot, Long Hot Summer of 1967\n- Topics: American period crime drama films\n\nFacts:\n- The 1967 Detroit riot, also known as the 12th Street riot or the 1967 Detroit rebellion, was one of 159 race riots that occurred across United States cities during the Long Hot Summer of 1967.\n- Detroit is a 2017 American period crime drama film directed by Kathryn Bigelow and written by Mark Boal.\n- Detroit is based on the Algiers Motel incident during Detroit's 1967 12th Street Riot, and its release commemorated the event's 50th anniversary.\n- Will Poulter, born on 28 January 1993, is an English actor known for film roles including Detroit.\n- Laz Alonso has had acting roles in films including Detroit.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
